  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>z</mi></math>&nbsp;is a complex number satisfying <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> cannot be",
